# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the values. `.env.local` is
# gitignored and must never be committed.
#
# The site runs fine with NONE of these set — the quote form works and logs
# submissions to the server console. Set them to make leads actually arrive.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── 1. Email delivery (the important one) ────────────────────────────────────
# Quote enquiries are emailed to sales@aucklandmoving.co.nz via Resend.
#   a) Sign up at https://resend.com (free tier covers ~3,000 emails/month)
#   b) Add and verify the aucklandmoving.co.nz domain
#   c) Create an API key and paste it below
RESEND_API_KEY=
# Must be an address on a domain you've verified with Resend.
QUOTE_FROM_EMAIL=website@aucklandmoving.co.nz


# ── 2. Google Sheet lead log (optional, recommended) ─────────────────────────
# Gives you a running spreadsheet of every enquiry tagged by move type — this
# is what answers "how many office leads are we actually getting?".
# Setup instructions are in README.md under "Google Sheet lead log".
GOOGLE_SHEET_WEBHOOK_URL=
# Any random string. Must match the SECRET in the Apps Script.
GOOGLE_SHEET_SECRET=


# ── 3. Google Analytics (optional) ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Without this, analytics calls are no-ops. With it, you get events for which
# service tab people open, which move types get submitted, and call vs email.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GA_ID=
